## Upstream models

SCOPEC's planned agents and assistant send prompts to a language model chosen by whoever runs it -
a hosted model under its provider's terms, or a locally run open-weight model under its own model
licence. The lab does not train, fine-tune or distribute models, and is not a provider of a
general-purpose AI model under the EU AI Act. Obligations for the models themselves sit with their
providers.

Output produced with these models is marked per EU AI Act Article 50. See COMPLIANCE.md.

